<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The launch screen (Claude Design, "Feature - Splash screen", 1a): the mark
  held still on the space colour (#05070D, sRGB). The Splash image is the
  mark's 144 pt box on a 288 pt canvas (mobile/scripts/make-icons.mjs),
  centred on the screen's geometric centre, not the safe area, and never
  scaled. @capacitor/splash-screen shows this same view until the web app's
  first screen has painted.
-->
